{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Dead Beyond</i> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in darkness\u2014disoriented, alone, and trapped inside a house that should not exist. The air is heavy with decay, and the silence is broken only by distant, guttural groans echoing through the halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This house is crawling with the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies roam every corridor, their lifeless eyes searching, their bodies driven by an endless hunger for flesh. They linger in the shadows, wait behind doors, and wander through rooms that feel more like cages than shelter. Every step you take risks drawing them closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the undead are only part of the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place has been engineered\u2014designed with cruel precision by a vengeful madman who turned this abandoned house into a personalized hell. Traps are hidden everywhere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted, mind-bending challenges stand between you and any hope of escape. They demand focus in moments of panic, clarity in the face of terror. Every second spent thinking is a second something else is hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room has a purpose.<br>Every corridor hides a threat.<br>Every mistake brings you closer to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no map. No guidance. No mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only your instincts, your reflexes, and your will to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outsmart the traps, outrun the dead, and escape this living nightmare\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you become just another corpse lost within its walls?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Beyond</strong> is a <i>First-Person Survival Horror</i> game that blends intense combat, atmospheric storytelling, and spine-chilling jump scares. But this isn\u2019t just another zombie shooter\u2014it\u2019s a psychological gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a house that feels alive, shifting with every level. Each floor presents new challenges, forcing you to adapt. One level might demand pure combat as zombies swarm in droves. Another may trap you in pitch-black corridors with nothing but your senses to guide you. And others may test your mind with intricate platforming or logic puzzles where failure means death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861610?t=1774620481","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861610/b86ed84eef5251e2457c3b2a21dc5f0633a3cc4c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774620481","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861610/2110e00f8247ee5341f1eb587719a06537e1b480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774620481","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861610/2110e00f8247ee5341f1eb587719a06537e1b480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774620481","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Basically Player only kills zombies walking inside the game and attacking our player. But there are lots of blood effects when zombies are shot or if our player is attacked and injured by the zombies or traps."},"demos":[{"appid":3909820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Dead Beyond</i> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in darkness\u2014disoriented, alone, and trapped inside a house that should not exist. The air is heavy with decay, and the silence is broken only by distant, guttural groans echoing through the halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This house is crawling with the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies roam every corridor, their lifeless eyes searching, their bodies driven by an endless hunger for flesh. They linger in the shadows, wait behind doors, and wander through rooms that feel more like cages than shelter. Every step you take risks drawing them closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the undead are only part of the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place has been engineered\u2014designed with cruel precision by a vengeful madman who turned this abandoned house into a personalized hell. Traps are hidden everywhere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted, mind-bending challenges stand between you and any hope of escape. They demand focus in moments of panic, clarity in the face of terror. Every second spent thinking is a second something else is hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room has a purpose.<br>Every corridor hides a threat.<br>Every mistake brings you closer to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no map. No guidance. No mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only your instincts, your reflexes, and your will to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outsmart the traps, outrun the dead, and escape this living nightmare\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you become just another corpse lost within its walls?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Beyond</strong> is a <i>First-Person Survival Horror</i> game that blends intense combat, atmospheric storytelling, and spine-chilling jump scares. But this isn\u2019t just another zombie shooter\u2014it\u2019s a psychological gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a house that feels alive, shifting with every level. Each floor presents new challenges, forcing you to adapt. One level might demand pure combat as zombies swarm in droves. Another may trap you in pitch-black corridors with nothing but your senses to guide you. And others may test your mind with intricate platforming or logic puzzles where failure means death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Volkan Kutlubay"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861610/7f976e7d1f51b9f3425aa810d45ff9f91d51e6d0/header.jpg?t=1774620481","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861610/1818044839/5fee1d51f87d08e1ae05eed2819502f908b094bf/1765902803/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765903221","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861610/1818044839/5fee1d51f87d08e1ae05eed2819502f908b094bf/1765902803/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765903221","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861610/1818044839/5fee1d51f87d08e1ae05eed2819502f908b094bf/1765902803/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765903221","id":257173001,"name":"DEAD BEYOND GAMEPLAY TRAILER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173001/de8338986d162a0f56d7218265d0ce3b29408146/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765903221"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861610/588387898/1cacd0f69405429a89fca98cd80b75de6de94142/1751709892/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755376689","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861610/588387898/1cacd0f69405429a89fca98cd80b75de6de94142/1751709892/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755376689","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3861610/5883